{"id":"persona-5s4b.18","title":"persona-grpc is not self-contained: build.rs reads ../proto outside the package dir","description":"persona-grpc/build.rs references "../proto/spiffe/workload/workload.proto" with include path "../proto". Cargo packages only files under the package root, so the .proto is excluded from any 'cargo package' / 'cargo vendor' output and from docs.rs builds. The crate compiles only from inside this workspace checkout.

That is tolerable while the workspace is the only consumer, but it forecloses publishing persona-grpc, vendoring it into another build, or building docs on docs.rs — and the failure mode is a build.rs error with a missing-file message, not anything that points at packaging.

